# Intermediate and re-creatable output of tools/build-apk.sh.
build/
*.apk
*.keystore
*.jks

# The one exception: release/ holds the artifact that is actually handed to the
# user. The pipeline needs a Java runtime plus the Android build-tools, which
# are not present on a normal checkout, so this APK cannot be rebuilt there -
# unlike everything under build/, it is a deliverable, not an intermediate.
!release/A5-Boot-Lab.apk

# apksigner also emits a v4 signature alongside the APK. Nothing here installs
# with adb --incremental, so the v4 blob is noise next to the tracked release.
*.idsig
